"Disk keeps working after the module is switched off and on again, and Keep Awake stops asking for your password every session." = "モジュールをオフ→オンしても“ディスク”が動き続け、“スリープ防止”が毎回パスワードを求めなくなりました。";
"Disk map" = "ディスクマップ";
"Disk no longer lets a top-level folder of the disk — Users, Applications, Library — go into the basket. What is inside them still can." = "“ディスク”で、ディスク直下のフォルダをバスケットに入れられないようにしました。中身は従来どおり入れられます。";
"Disk takes a second look: a duplicate finder. Point it at the folder the ring is showing and it lists files that exist more than once — content compared, not names. One copy in each group is marked as the one that stays; the extras go to the basket, and deletion runs through the same guarded path as everything else. Hard links are one file and are never offered." = "“ディスク”がもう一度チェック：重複ファイル検索。リングが示すフォルダを対象に、複数存在するファイルを一覧します。名前ではなく内容を比較。各グループの 1 つは残す印が付き、余分はバスケットへ。ハードリンクは同一ファイルなので提案されません。";
"Display and power" = "ディスプレイと電源";
"Document" = "書類";
"Done" = "完了";
"Don’t fix" = "修正しない";
"Double ring" = "二重リング";
"Download" = "ダウンロード";
"Downloaded from" = "ダウンロード元";
"Downloading…" = "ダウンロード中…";
"Drag modules into the order you want them in the menu-bar panel." = "モジュールをドラッグしてメニューバーパネルでの順序を変更できます。";
"Duplicates" = "重複";
"Duplicates can basket every extra at once, and Space shows you a file before you bin it. “All extras to basket” does across every group what the per-group button did — one copy of everything always stays, which is why it is not called “Select all”. Beside “Move to Trash” there is now a “Clear”, so one press can undo one press." = "“重複”で余分なコピーをまとめてバスケットに入れられます。スペースキーで削除前にファイルを確認できます。各グループのコピーは必ず 1 つ残るので、ボタン名は“すべて選択”ではありません。“ゴミ箱に入れる”の横に“クリア”が付きました。";
"Duplicates keeps the copy that was there first, by the same \"Date Added\" the Finder shows. It used to keep whichever path came first alphabetically, so a copy on the Desktop beat the filed original and Helm offered the wrong one for deletion." = "“重複”は先にあったコピーを残します。Finder と同じ“追加日”で判断し、パスのアルファベット順ではなくなりました。";
"Each login item now offers what is actually possible: turn it off, show it in Finder, or delete it — with a word about why, when a password would be needed." = "各ログイン項目に、実際に可能な操作だけを表示：オフにする、Finderに表示、削除。パスワードが必要な場合はその理由も示します。";
"Each module’s saved data and the diagnostics log go to the Trash, where you can get them back. Your preferences — which modules are on, their order, your shortcuts — are forgotten for good. Helm restarts and greets you as it did the first time." = "各モジュールの保存データと診断ログはゴミ箱に移動するので、あとで戻せます。設定そのもの（オンのモジュール、その並び順、ショートカット）は完全に失われます。Helm は再起動し、初回と同じように迎えます。";
"Early builds with new features — expect rough edges." = "新機能を含む早期ビルド。不具合があるかもしれません。";
"Edit" = "編集";
"Emoji & Symbols" = "絵文字と記号";
"Enable a module in Settings." = "設定でモジュールを有効にしてください。";
"Errors" = "エラー";
"Escape closes the menu-bar panel, the way it closes every other menu on the Mac. It could be opened with a keyboard shortcut and then only be closed with the mouse." = "Esc キーでメニューバーパネルを閉じられます。キーボードで開けるのに、閉じるにはマウスが必要でした。";
"Every layout has a real flag now. Helm drew them itself for a while, but a table of bands and crosses cannot hold Mexico’s eagle, Portugal’s armillary sphere or Korea’s trigrams — half a dozen flags were approximations because of it. These come from flag-icons under the MIT licence (credited on this page): rectangular, accurate, and legible down to the smallest badge size. A layout that names no country still keeps its letters." = "すべての配列に本物の旗が付きました。MIT ライセンスの flag-icons です（このページに表示）。長方形で正確、最小サイズでも読み取れます。国が定まらない配列は文字のままです。";
"Everything" = "すべて";
"Everything is up to date." = "すべて最新です。";
"Extension" = "拡張子";
"Extensions, separated by commas" = "拡張子（カンマ区切り）";
"External display" = "外部ディスプレイ";
"Failed" = "失敗";
